  "bodyHash": "sKu6yVbwujs=",
  "content": "你好世界<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪者入侵將Minecraft的掠奪者帶到全新境界！將近十種擁有獨特能力的新掠奪者將在世界中出沒。有些潛伏在危險的新建築中，有些則加入村莊襲擊，使戰鬥更加艱難。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對抗更聰明的敵人、尋找強力戰利品、發掘隱藏地點。新的挑戰帶來新的獎勵——一路上樂趣無窮！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 新掠奪者</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">煉金術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：精通弓箭的專家，受挑釁時會投擲滯留藥水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">檔案管理員</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為附近的掠奪者施加附魔增益。害怕時會逃跑並施法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衝撞者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：持盾的惡霸，會向玩家衝鋒。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：遠程掠奪者，投擲致命的飛斧——有機會從他身上搶到</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鉑金灌注飛斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">挑釁者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用弓箭的掠奪者，擁有基本增益法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">巫師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：難以捉摸的施法者，能召喚危險的紫色火焰。會掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">奇異之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">死靈法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：亡靈大師，能召喚法術壓制玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">審判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：強大的掠奪者戰士，持有強力盾牌——必須先擊破他的盾牌才能擊敗他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰召喚者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：看似無害的神秘法師，直到他釋放出毀滅性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">喚魔者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：最強大的掠奪者！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用於</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">升級附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：現在以全新外觀出現在生存模式！會掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻影之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新建築</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰召喚者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：帶有農田的小房屋。生成於惡地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪者堡壘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：設有城牆、塔樓和強力掠奪者的防禦據點。生成於針葉林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：多層塔樓，充滿掠奪者，頂層有幻術師戰鬥。生成於針葉林和黑森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷宮</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：巨大的地下迷宮，充滿大量戰利品和更多掠奪者。尋找石造寺廟入口！生成於大多數森林生態域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">巫師小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小型房屋建築。生成於黑森林。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：將附魔升級至超越極限！每次使用需要一顆</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鉑金灌注飛斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可投擲的斧類武器，掠奪者較低機率掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">失落燭台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：幫助尋找附近的礦石，揭示其位置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視野號角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使附近的怪物發光，更快找到它們！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端和伺服器端都需要安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需要安裝</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製作）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需要安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，命名方式為</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，依設定類型而定。並非所有類型都會存在於每個模組中。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 特別感謝</span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他最初創作了驚人的 Illager Expansion 模組。掠奪者入侵是其作品的忠實延續，並加入了許多新增、改進、調整和錯誤修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 感謝</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/ZekeSmith\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他在 Dricky 刪除原始 Illager Expansion 原始碼後找到了它，使得在</span><a href=\"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">許可證條款下進行移植成為可能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">負責 1.19.2 版本的 Illager Expansion，視野號角的紋理取自該版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">創作了許多令人驚嘆的新紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
